{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32147","headline":"台城晓朝曲 · 温庭筠","name":"台城晓朝曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"司马门前火千炬，兰干星斗天将曙。\n朱网龛鬖丞相车，晓随叠鼓朝天去。\n博山镜树香䒠茸，褭褭浮航金画龙。\n大江歛势避辰极，两阙深严烟翠浓。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32147.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32147","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}